# Uploaded to Vercel only for the Django (Vercel + Supabase) profile, whose project root is the repo root.
# The root api/ folder holds a PHP contract file used by the VPS deploy scripts; Vercel treats /api as its
# functions folder, so it must not be uploaded or /api/v1/... could stop reaching Django.
# Vercel installs runtime packages from requirements.txt; pyproject.toml only contains local tool config.
# Exclude local credentials, virtualenvs, frontend dependencies, collected assets and user data.
/api/
/docs/
/nextjs/
/pyproject.toml
/.tmp-nextjs-runtime/
/.serena/
/.wt-docs-ask/
/.venv/
/build/
/dist/
/node_modules/
/test/
/staticfiles/
/media/
/uploads/
/.venv314/
/.env*
**/.env*
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.log
